---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Security & Trust | Enterprise Data Governance | Ceres"
  description="Ceres delivers enterprise-grade AI security with full audit trails, data compartmentalization, and compliance-ready governance for supply chain teams."
>
  <main class="flex-grow flex flex-col w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 gap-16 pt-24">

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="flex flex-col gap-6 max-w-4xl">
      <h1 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface leading-none">
        Enterprise trust starts with clear systems, controlled data flows, and outputs your teams can explain.
      </h1>
      <p class="font-body font-normal text-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] max-w-3xl">
        Ceres is built for organizations that need to merge internal records with external signals without creating new bottlenecks, black boxes, or operational risk.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- BENTO GRID: CORE CONCEPTS -->
    <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="md:col-span-1 bg-surface-container flex flex-col gap-6 p-8 ghost-border hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-outline-variant/30 pb-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-2xl">verified_user</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-headline font-extrabold text-on-surface tracking-[-0.01em] leading-none">Trust at Ceres</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-sm text-on-surface-variant">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-lg shrink-0 mt-0.5">check_box</span>
            <span class="font-body font-normal leading-[1.7]">Zero-friction integration with existing operational stacks.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-lg shrink-0 mt-0.5">check_box</span>
            <span class="font-body font-normal leading-[1.7]">Strict compartmentalization of sensitive enterprise data.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-lg shrink-0 mt-0.5">check_box</span>
            <span class="font-body font-normal leading-[1.7]">Full auditability of every decision output and model inference.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-2 bg-surface-container flex flex-col gap-6 p-8 ghost-border hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors machined-gradient relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-9xl">account_tree</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-outline-variant/30 pb-4 relative z-10">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-2xl">architecture</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-headline font-extrabold text-on-surface tracking-[-0.01em] leading-none">Enterprise Architecture Fit</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] relative z-10 max-w-2xl">
          Ceres sits on top of your existing ERPs, databases, and core infrastructure. It pulls in the signals you need without requiring a full data migration.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4 relative z-10">
          <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4 border border-outline-variant/20 flex flex-col gap-2">
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-outline">Layer 1</span>
            <span class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em]">Existing ERP/DB Core</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4 border border-outline-variant/20 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t-2 border-t-primary">
            <span class="section-label">Layer 2</span>
            <span class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em]">Ceres Decision Engine</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- DATA HANDLING PRINCIPLES -->
    <section class="flex flex-col gap-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface leading-none border-b border-outline-variant/30 pb-4">
        Data Handling Principles
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 ghost-border hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-2xl">input</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em]">Least-Friction Integration</h3>
          <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Connects directly to required endpoints without demanding wholesale data migration.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 ghost-border hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-2xl">schema</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em]">Purpose-Built Workflows</h3>
          <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Data is processed strictly within the context of predefined, authorized analytical tasks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 ghost-border hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors border-t-2 border-t-outline-variant">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-2xl">route</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em]">Clear Input-to-Output Path</h3>
          <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Every analytical conclusion can be traced back to its specific source vectors.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 ghost-border hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-2xl">cycle</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em]">Repeatable Analysis</h3>
          <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Consistent models ensure that the same inputs reliably yield the same explainable outputs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HIGH-STAKES & EXPLAINABILITY -->
    <section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-surface-container p-8 flex flex-col gap-6 ghost-border">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-2xl">visibility</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] leading-none text-on-surface">Radical Explainability</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">
          Black box AI is a liability in enterprise operations. Ceres provides transparent diagnostic tools allowing analysts to interrogate outputs, challenge assumptions, and understand the weight of every variable influencing a decision.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4 border border-outline-variant/30 flex justify-between items-center mt-auto">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-outline">Every output is traceable to its source</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-sm">verified</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface-container p-8 flex flex-col gap-6 ghost-border">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-2xl">gavel</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] leading-none text-on-surface">Reliability for High-Stakes</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant">
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-outline-variant/20 pb-2">
            <span>Operational Risk Reduction</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-sm">arrow_downward</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-outline-variant/20 pb-2">
            <span>Compliance Audit Readiness</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-sm">check</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-outline-variant/20 pb-2">
            <span>Downtime Mitigation Strategies</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-sm">shield_locked</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-outline-variant/20 pb-2">
            <span>Failover Protocol Activation</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-sm">power</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="bg-surface-container-high p-12 flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-6 mt-8 industrial-shadow ghost-border relative overflow-hidden">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] leading-none text-on-surface relative z-10 max-w-2xl">
        Need a closer look at how Ceres fits your environment?
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant text-sm leading-[1.7] relative z-10">
        Schedule a technical review with our systems architecture team.
      </p>
      <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/") ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "book-a-demo/" : import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "/book-a-demo/"} class="mt-4 btn-primary relative z-10">
        Book a Demo
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
      </a>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>
